{"id": "86023", "name": "אינטגרציה בחלקים – a·x·sin(x/k) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Integrate {{CT:0}} with respect to {{CT:1}}.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Integration by parts</b><br>If \\(u\\) and \\(v\\) are both functions of \\(x\\) then<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int u dv = uv - \\int v du. \\]</p>Let \\(u = {{CT:2}}\\) and \\(dv = {{CT:3}} d{{CT:4}}\\). Then \\(du = {{CT:5}} d{{CT:4}}\\) and \\(v = {{CT:6}}\\). So,<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:7}} d{{CT:4}} &= \\int u dv \\\\ &= uv - \\int v du \\\\ &= {{CT:2}}\\cdot \\left({{CT:6}}\\right) - \\int {{CT:6}}\\cdot \\left({{CT:5}}\\right)d{{CT:4}} \\\\ &= {{CT:8}} - \\int {{CT:9}}d{{CT:4}} \\\\ &= {{CT:10}} + c \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "int", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "int(p,v)+c", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "rdm1", "rdm2", "v"], "nvariants": 12}